    },
    "Your recent typical: %@ · %d earlier day(s)" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Your recent typical: %@ · %d earlier day(s)" } }, "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Zuletzt typisch für Sie: %@ · %d frühere Tage" } } }
    },
    "As you record on more days under similar conditions, your personal comparison will appear here." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "As you record on more days under similar conditions, your personal comparison will appear here." } }, "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Wenn Sie an weiteren Tagen unter ähnlichen Bedingungen aufnehmen, erscheint hier Ihr persönlicher Vergleich." } } }
    },
    "Your movement pattern will appear after a usable recording." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Your movement pattern will appear after a usable recording." } }, "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Nach einer auswertbaren Aufnahme erscheint hier Ihr Bewegungsmuster." } } }
    },
    "Rate counts repetitions per second. Rhythm variability describes how evenly they repeat: lower values mean more even intervals. Movement size describes how widely you moved, relative to your palm." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Rate counts repetitions per second. Rhythm variability describes how evenly they repeat: lower values mean more even intervals. Movement size describes how widely you moved, relative to your palm." } }, "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Die Wiederholungsrate zählt Wiederholungen pro Sekunde. Die Rhythmusvariabilität beschreibt deren Gleichmäßigkeit: Niedrigere Werte bedeuten gleichmäßigere Zeitabstände. Die Bewegungsgröße beschreibt, wie weit Sie sich bewegt haben, bezogen auf Ihre Handfläche." } } }
    },
    "Finger movement speed describes how quickly the camera-view finger angle changes. It is different from tapping rate and is affected by hand position and tracking." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Finger movement speed describes how quickly the camera-view finger angle changes. It is different from tapping rate and is affected by hand position and tracking." } }, "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Die Geschwindigkeit der Fingerbewegung beschreibt, wie schnell sich der Fingerwinkel im Kamerabild ändert. Sie unterscheidet sich von der Tipprate und wird durch Handposition und Erkennung beeinflusst." } } }
    },
    "Your recent typical values are medians from up to seven earlier matching recording days. We keep hand, stimulation timing, reported medication status and recording method separate. Filters apply; days with repeated recordings receive equal weight." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Your recent typical values are medians from up to seven earlier matching recording days. We keep hand, stimulation timing, reported medication status and recording method separate. Filters apply; days with repeated recordings receive equal weight." } }, "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Ihre zuletzt typischen Werte sind Mediane aus bis zu sieben früheren passenden Aufnahmetagen. Hand, Stimulationszeitpunkt, angegebener Medikamentenstatus und Aufnahmemethode werden getrennt betrachtet. Die Filter gelten auch hier; Tage mit mehreren Aufnahmen werden gleich gewichtet." } } }
    },
    "These measures help describe your movement pattern. Faster or larger does not automatically mean better, and small differences may reflect normal recording variation." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "These measures help describe your movement pattern. Faster or larger does not automatically mean better, and small differences may reflect normal recording variation." } }, "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Diese Messwerte helfen, Ihr Bewegungsmuster zu beschreiben. Schneller oder größer bedeutet nicht automatisch besser; kleine Unterschiede können durch normale Schwankungen bei der Aufnahme entstehen." } } }
    },
    "Latest available comparison" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Latest available comparison" } }, "de" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Letzter verfügbarer Vergleich" } } }
